                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "99ca2e28-00cc-3b5f-a338-9df343bb1b3e",
                                        "entry_id": "20c8987a-0428-389b-963d-9d24c1d50f65",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A person who carries luggage and related objects."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "896fceb8-da75-4cb2-a95b-ef440662b0c7",
                                                "sense_id": "99ca2e28-00cc-3b5f-a338-9df343bb1b3e",
                                                "text": "By the time I reached the train station I was exhausted, but fortunately there was a porter waiting."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "159054e4-0ac2-4049-9a6f-c7234646d20d",
                                                "sense_id": "99ca2e28-00cc-3b5f-a338-9df343bb1b3e",
                                                "text": "Achilles! a drayman, a porter, a very camel."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "11df132d-7075-48b8-b8a5-694a0b671866",
                                                "sense_id": "99ca2e28-00cc-3b5f-a338-9df343bb1b3e",
                                                "text": "the unsmotherable delight of all the porters and by - standers"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "dbe6827c-493c-4dc2-8051-f04516057e30",
                                                "sense_id": "99ca2e28-00cc-3b5f-a338-9df343bb1b3e",
                                                "text": "The man who carries your luggage at the station is a \"red cap\", not a porter. The Canadian porter is the man who makes up the beds in the sleeping cars."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b1544956-b6d6-429d-9d7e-20f45d1d9fb6",
                                                "sense_id": "99ca2e28-00cc-3b5f-a338-9df343bb1b3e",
                                                "text": "As soon as we had come to a stand in Kamina Station, a swarm of porters pushed their way into the compartment to get my luggage. I selected one, and ordered the others out, and then detrained."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "144338c0-84b6-4a42-993c-bff9b62ba8d9",
                                                "sense_id": "99ca2e28-00cc-3b5f-a338-9df343bb1b3e",
                                                "text": "Tips were an important part of porters' income, and at Christmas passengers felt there was extra pressure to give them - despite some perceiving the level of service to be poor."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "9aab3f9f-1a58-3584-ab35-0ac713de9a48",
                                        "entry_id": "20c8987a-0428-389b-963d-9d24c1d50f65",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An ant having the specialized role of carrying."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "2fc110f0-0fc2-369f-8c2a-32755c704a0f",
                                        "entry_id": "20c8987a-0428-389b-963d-9d24c1d50f65",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "One who ports software (makes it usable on another platform)."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "85b9c1f6-a72c-4521-8bdb-be5c8ad74439",
                                                "sense_id": "2fc110f0-0fc2-369f-8c2a-32755c704a0f",
                                                "text": "[…] useful only if you are a Perl porter or implementor and you want to check the efficiency of the hashing algorithm."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
